{"t":"Gnome Deep Hub","s":"gnome-deep-hub-4b87d","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Lava_Lurker_bf7ff1.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gnome Deep Hub</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Lava Lurker\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lava_Lurker_bf7ff1.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Under the eastern sea, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33752,32190,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33752, 32190, 14)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.50.6055<br/>December 5, 2017<br/>Winter Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Gnome Deep Hub</b> is an advanced post on the war against Those Below. Despite their rivalry, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomes\">Gnomes</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarves\">Dwarves</a> have joined forces to fight this evil threat and are fighting in different fronts across this base. \n</p><p>Its <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32624,31868,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">entrance (32624, 31868, 11)</a> can be reached by walking from Kazordoon or by travelling to the city using the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">Gnomish Crystal Teleport System</a>. The entrances to <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%204\">Warzone 4</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%205\">Warzone 5</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%206\">Warzone 6</a> are also located here. \n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/dangerous-depths-quest\">Dangerous Depths Quest</a> takes place here.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>East dungeon - Gnomes</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ravenous%20Lava%20Lurker\"><img alt=\"Lava Lurker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lava_Lurker_bf7ff1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ravenous%20Lava%20Lurker\">Ravenous Lava Lurker</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">4,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">320</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>South dungeon - Scouts</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepworm\"><img alt=\"Deepworm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"asset